     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div>New version of methylKit compatible with R 3.0 and corresponding bioconductor dependencies is now available.</div><div><br></div><div>To install copy-paste the following in<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.25em\"> R console,</span></div>\r\n<div><pre style=\"font-size:12px;padding:0.5em;overflow:auto;font-family:Monaco,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,monospace;max-width:70em;background-color:rgb(238,238,238);color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<span>source</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;<a href=\"http://methylkit.googlecode.com/files/install.methylKit.R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://methylkit.googlecode.com/files/install.methylKit.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793235166094000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Wdj3LUr5CpLEPdG_HJn1Y\">http://methylkit.googlecode.com/files/install.methylKit.R</a>&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span><br>\r\n<br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(136,0,0)\"># installing the package with the dependencies</span><span><br>install</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">.</span><span>methylKit</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span>ver</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\">&quot;0.5.7&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">,</span><span>dependencies</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">=</span><span>TRUE</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span></pre>\r\n</div><div><br></div><div>In addition, we have a new Q&amp;A forum to ask questions, you can send your questions directly to <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial,sans-serif;line-height:16.390625px\"> </span><a href rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,204);font-family:arial,sans-serif;line-height:16.390625px\" data-email-masked>methylkit_...@googlegroups.com</a> or <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial,sans-serif;line-height:16.390625px\">post a question using </span><a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!forum/methylkit_discussion\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,204);font-family:arial,sans-serif;line-height:16.390625px\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/%23!forum/methylkit_discussion&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793235166094000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2md1QiQMofjuELY09GxbXZ\">the web interface</a>.</div>\r\n<div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Altuna</div></div>\r\n"
